From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] send people to the right place for each thing

Anything about this build - what it is, what changed, where the code is -
belongs here, so the home url and the ssh banner point at this repository.

Bugs do not. BUG_REPORT_URL follows the git origin, which on a fork is the
fork, and almost everything in the image is CoreELEC's work: reports about
it should reach the people who can act on them. Pin it back to CoreELEC.

diff --git a/distributions/CoreELEC/options b/distributions/CoreELEC/options
index 5c03ce537e..eb91ef5759 100644
--- a/distributions/CoreELEC/options
+++ b/distributions/CoreELEC/options
@@ -11,12 +11,12 @@
   DISTRO_SRC="https://sources.libreelec.tv/$DISTRO_VERSION"
 
 # Distribution Home URL
-  DISTRO_HOME_URL="https://coreelec.org"
+  DISTRO_HOME_URL="https://github.com/allolive/CoreELEC"
 
 # Welcome Message for SSH Server (up to 5 Lines)
   GREETING0="##############################################"
   GREETING1="#                  CoreELEC                  #"
-  GREETING2="#            https://coreelec.org            #"
+  GREETING2="#  https://github.com/allolive/CoreELEC      #"
   GREETING3="##############################################"
   GREETING4=""
 
diff --git a/scripts/image b/scripts/image
index 2b2ee68d3e..56565fd01b 100755
--- a/scripts/image
+++ b/scripts/image
@@ -179,7 +179,7 @@ ID="${DISTRONAME,,}"
 VERSION_ID="${OS_VERSION}"
 PRETTY_NAME="${DISTRONAME} (${DISTRO_BUILD}): ${DISTRO_VERSION}"
 HOME_URL="${DISTRO_HOME_URL}"
-BUG_REPORT_URL="${ORIGIN_URL}"
+BUG_REPORT_URL="https://github.com/CoreELEC/CoreELEC"
 BUILD_ID="${GIT_HASH}"
 DISTRO_ARCH="${DISTRO_ARCH}"
 DISTRO_BUILD="${DISTRO_BUILD}"
